ven makeshift traps to keep zombies at bay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/3b5541b79dad9ee4511bfc332bca2f60.poster.avif?t=1787566527\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/3b5541b79dad9ee4511bfc332bca2f60.webm?t=1787566527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/3b5541b79dad9ee4511bfc332bca2f60.mp4?t=1787566527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/40aba1f6b1e5a83b1ec656a53c2bdc69.avif?t=1787566527\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be a benevolent shopkeeper or an opportunistic overlord. Help the community, price gouge, or even sabotage settlements for profit. Your reputation determines who comes knocking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/cd15cead433cba812ac0af8983cfd472.poster.avif?t=1787566527\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/cd15cead433cba812ac0af8983cfd472.webm?t=1787566527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/cd15cead433cba812ac0af8983cfd472.mp4?t=1787566527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i></i><br>In <strong>The Walking Trade</strong>, every decision shapes your survival. Build, fight, and thrive in the apocalypse—your way!<